     "html": "Ebatzi <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̈</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>x</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̇</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>  (bildumako 10. ariketa)."
