     "mota": "testua",
     "html": "Kurtsoko ebazpen-dosier tipografiatutik (CG-01), osorik legible: askatu <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mover><mi>y</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̈</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mover><mi>y</mi><mo accent=\"true\">̇</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>−</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>, non"
