       "mota": "testua",
       "html": "<code class=\"formula-ez\">pi &lt;= t &lt; 2 pi: #h(0.8em) x = 5/4 cosh 2 (t - pi) - 1/4,</code> <code class=\"formula-ez\">2 pi &lt;= t &lt; 3 pi: #h(0.8em) x = 5/4 cosh 2 (t - pi) - t/4 \\ + 1/8 sinh 2 (t - 2 pi) + (2 pi - 1)/4 cosh 2 (t - 2 pi),</code> <code class=\"formula-ez\">t &gt;= 3 pi: #h(0.8em) x = 5/4 cosh 2 (t - pi) + 1/8 sinh 2 (t - 2 pi) + (2 pi - 1)/4 cosh 2 (t - 2 pi) \\ - 1/8 sinh 2 (t - 3 pi) - (3 pi)/4 cosh 2 (t - 3 pi).</code>"
